  "note": "Raw artifacts are local ignored outputs; hashes document provenance, not independent attestation. Decisions were recorded in SQLite before this export.",
  "decisions": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "updated_at": "2026-09-09T18:55:08.899Z",
      "updated_by": "auto:codex",
      "status": "REVIEW",
      "reason": "Read-only feasibility audit on feature/bearlett; preserve existing changes; isolated regtest only; no implementation, publication or source checkout modifications."
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "updated_at": "2026-09-09T19:04:03.319Z",
      "updated_by": "user:felix",
      "status": "REVIEW",
      "reason": "V1: exactly one active writing device with explicit handover; concurrent multi-device spending is out of V1 scope."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "updated_at": "2026-09-09T19:04:03.350Z",
      "updated_by": "auto:codex",
      "status": "REVIEW",
      "reason": "Four isolated reproductions confirm omitted melt change completion, unauthenticated backup item omission, foreign-seed import before Cashu enable, and 100-counter recovery gap. Document before implementation; keep current wallet source unchanged."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "updated_at": "2026-09-09T19:07:10.914Z",
      "updated_by": "auto:codex",
      "status": "REVIEW",
      "reason": "F00 reproduced: installed official shim resolves storage result ok:false; Kehto persistence catches failures and returns false. Prioritize durable host storage boundary before new platforms. Regtest passes after fresh block; recommend shared TypeScript core, native adapters, independent wallet Nostr key, NIP78 encrypted full journal backup and explicit single-writer handover."
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "updated_at": "2026-09-09T19:14:14.233Z",
      "updated_by": "auto:codex",
      "status": "REVIEW",
      "reason": "User requests Monero and USDT swaps as side question. Granola testnet Cashu sat/usd is not native XMR/USDT and dni wallet has no integration. Record future extension, keep current verification scope; requested pairs and USDT network pending clarification."
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "updated_at": "2026-09-09T19:16:30.961Z",
      "updated_by": "user:felix",
      "status": "REVIEW",
      "reason": "Preferred future XMR/USDT swaps always through mints using Breno Granola. Architecture: LNURLcash to Cashu sats via Lightning; Cashu HTLC swap to asset-backed ecash; separate mint redemption. No verified XMR/USDT mint or redemption backend yet; keep as gated extension after V1 safety work, no implementation authorized in this check."
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "updated_at": "2026-09-09T19:17:30.674Z",
      "updated_by": "auto:codex",
      "status": "REVIEW",
      "reason": "Completed four German feasibility/architecture/sources/infrastructure reports and five isolated bug reproductions. Original wallet code and user edits preserved. Reproductions and typecheck rerun successfully; regtest stack stopped with volumes retained. No full implementation, public deployment or commit."
    }
  ],
